PRESENTER: Pretty good, huh?

01:04:14.000 --> 01:04:14.500
Enjoy it.

01:04:14.500 --> 01:04:15.083
KETTERLE: Huh?

01:04:15.083 --> 01:04:16.115
PRESENTER: Enjoy it.

01:04:16.115 --> 01:04:16.985
KETTERLE: Thanks.

01:04:16.985 --> 01:04:20.464
